itu_mid.csv is derived from mids.json of https://github.com/michaeljfazio/MIDs at commit
ebcc3c8fbb7ada9df11f857e78db2400f1e08155, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0, whose
text is itu_mid.LICENSE. The derivation converts the JSON to CSV: one row per Maritime
Identification Digits code, codes ascending, holding the code and the fourth field of its entry,
the name of the administration the code is allocated to. This command reproduces itu_mid.csv byte
for byte:

  curl -sL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/michaeljfazio/MIDs/ebcc3c8fbb7ada9df11f857e78db2400f1e08155/mids.json \
    | python3 -c 'import csv, json, sys; d = json.load(sys.stdin); w = csv.writer(sys.stdout, lineterminator="\n"); w.writerow(["mid", "allocated_to"]); [w.writerow([k, d[k][3]]) for k in sorted(d, key=int)]' \
    > itu_mid.csv
